OPENSEQ 'data' READONLY TO F ELSE STOP
READSEQ V FROM F ELSE STOP
SEEK F, 2, 1 ELSE STOP
READSEQ V FROM F ELSE STOP
CRT V
SEEK F, -3, 1 ELSE STOP
READSEQ V FROM F ELSE STOP
CRT V
SEEK F, -5, 2 ELSE STOP
READSEQ V FROM F ELSE STOP
CRT V
READSEQ V FROM F THEN STOP ELSE NULL
SEEK F SETTING S THEN CRT S ELSE STOP
READSEQ V FROM F ELSE STOP
CRT V
SEEK F, -99, 1 SETTING S THEN STOP ELSE CRT S
SEEK F, '9223372036854775807', 2 THEN STOP ELSE NULL
SEEK F, 0, 3 THEN STOP ELSE NULL
SEEK F, 'bad' THEN STOP ELSE NULL
READSEQ V FROM F ELSE STOP
CRT V
CLOSESEQ F
OPENSEQ 'data' TO F ELSE STOP
SEEK F, 1 ELSE STOP
WRITESEQ 'Z' TO F ELSE STOP
SEEK F, 0, 2 ELSE STOP
WRITESEQ 'end' TO F ELSE STOP
SEEK F, 2, 2 ELSE STOP
WRITESEQ 'gap' TO F ELSE STOP
CLOSESEQ F
OPENSEQ 'absent' TO F THEN STOP ELSE NULL
SEEK F SETTING S THEN STOP ELSE CRT S
